            "review_title": "Review at Canh Ghe Ut Gao",
            "review_text": "Betty t\nBrampton, Canada10636 contributions\n0\nMy First Taste of Pho in Old Hanoi\nNov 2018 • Solo\nIt was hard communicating in English in Hanoi and on my very first day in Old Hanoi I had a hard time looking for a good Pho restaurant not knowing it was just two doors away from my hotel. \n\nI was walking around when I saw this restaurant with menu boards written in English and I know I would have an easier time ordering my food here.\n\nThey offer very familiar menu items those that I usually order in any Vietnamese restaurant in Canada so it was easy asking for my first bowl of Pho.\n\nThe Pho was delicious and cheap . They however only accept cash.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 1, 2019",
